      "Replication": "Disabled",
      "Description": "Allows for DesignScript code to be authored directly",
      "Code": "delta_list = List.Flatten([min_delta,deltas,max_delta],-1);\n\nmin_deltas = List.DropItems(delta_list,-1);\nmax_deltas = List.DropItems(delta_list,1);"
